  "description": "Production-ready hybrid post-quantum cryptography library for .NET authentication. Combines classical ECDSA P-256 with post-quantum ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204) to provide quantum-resistant JWT signing and validation. Features drop-in ASP.NET Core integration, standard JWT format with embedded pq-sig claim, platform-aware ML-DSA support, and comprehensive key management. Built for .NET 10 and C# 14.",
